// Windows Update health tracking starter
// Purpose: pair Intune remediation deployment with Defender/Intune update posture review.
// Notes: table availability differs by tenant/licensing. Validate table names in Advanced Hunting before production use.

DeviceInfo
| where Timestamp > ago(7d)
| summarize LastSeen=max(Timestamp), DeviceCount=dcount(DeviceId) by OSPlatform, OSVersion
| order by LastSeen desc
